{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2022-10", "window": 2, "start_date": 1665187200, "end_date": 1665878399, "month_true_total": 111, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:57:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "123895493", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015875874", "personaname": "ianislavus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ianislavus/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 15334, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15334, "last_played": 1665875735, "avatar": "27c3c6d8a48e4f0f8614ff139cf1e798ebbca542"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fantastic game! Played for over 250 hours and had a LOT of fun.\nPlus:\n - interesting missions and beautiful sights\n - smartly solved exploring\n - free world allows you to plan missions as you wish (with exception)\nMinus:\n - some missions require you to look for something without any hint, so you waste a lot of time\n - for me one mission couldn't be completed, because I was not aware of dependencies", "timestamp_created": 1665877286, "timestamp_updated": 1665877286, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "123894767", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080110320", "personaname": "Nano", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198080110320/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 805, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 805, "last_played": 1665769155, "avatar": "d476185c0b35498941c59eed221dfb307371f65c"}, "language": "english", "review": "For a game about discovery, exploration and adventure, there are many factors in the game that takes away the feeling of even being an explorer. WE never get to establish first contact, WE don't get experience of being a pioneer since there are bases in planets we land. Character development isn't that great either - at times, it feels like the game is trying to force us to care about the crew.\n\nI'll probably keep pushing through it out of my love for the original trilogy, but so far it's a disappointing game.", "timestamp_created": 1665875886, "timestamp_updated": 1665875886, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502351880073547363", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123874260", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040162118", "personaname": "Hugh Jass", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040162118/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 73, "playtime_forever": 6385, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1393, "last_played": 1669518813, "avatar": "d84079b6b48b0470712a5929ccee5222ff258dcd"}, "language": "english", "review": "yay", "timestamp_created": 1665848000, "timestamp_updated": 1665848000, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123865278", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972653315", "personaname": "Stesh", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972653315/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 57, "playtime_forever": 9009, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9009, "last_played": 160875538